    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/af889d0f3e422df846e989ae5fd52190.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>Embark on an incredible adventure through the Edgeland with Wawa United! Control one or several frogs, or bring your friends along to embark on incredible quests for riches and rewards!<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/d0f95e3f7b426b13fedc7564379edff9.avif?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/ac8700196d648140d2e09889aa36092a.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>Wawa United is a cooperative platformer where players must work together to navigate through levels, solve puzzles, and defeat enemies, all while competing to collect the most gems! Each level can be played solo by controlling multiple characters simultaneously, or with friends in multiplayer mode.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/7c9e0f865ccf2c09ccecb3a675f2435c.poster.avif?t=1719738371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/7c9e0f865ccf2c09ccecb3a675f2435c.webm?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/7c9e0f865ccf2c09ccecb3a675f2435c.mp4?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/4ffa513e23603384ac81ff5baeee49f7.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>Before setting off on your adventure, invite your friends to visit your lair. Impress them with your collection! Display all the treasures you\u2019ve collected on your adventures in your lobby for everyone to see. Discover different merchants scattered around the world who offer unique items for purchase.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/8bcf9f01797b3a77e6a8b472b98bfbba.poster.avif?t=1719738371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/8bcf9f01797b3a77e6a8b472b98bfbba.webm?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/8bcf9f01797b3a77e6a8b472b98bfbba.mp4?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/d86c9578e978a63d49d0ad6501d4cbe3.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>To complete levels, teamwork is essential, but always keep an eye on the precious gems scattered along the way. Don\u2019t be too greedy though\u2014one wrong move could cause your whole team to lose previous gems!<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/82e1dd253c0f3ecc93543c08d9228342.poster.avif?t=1719738371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/82e1dd253c0f3ecc93543c08d9228342.webm?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/82e1dd253c0f3ecc93543c08d9228342.mp4?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/3e4649dcfa22c1e6944197aa5e41644b.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>The Infinite Tower offers a special challenge: a level that only ends once you\u2019ve taken 10 hits. Only the bravest adventurers can reap the biggest rewards! Your performances will be ranked with every player out there. If you manage to get ahead of the crowd, your name will be seen by everyone on the banners scattered within the Tower! Beware, so shall your grave!<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/e50e0208c9ff6bd73b2253374a5c6cd4.poster.avif?t=1719738371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/e50e0208c9ff6bd73b2253374a5c6cd4.webm?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/e50e0208c9ff6bd73b2253374a5c6cd4.mp4?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Levels are available for either 2 players (currently) or 4 players (in the future), with the option to play through matchmaking or by inviting your Steam friends.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/af889d0f3e422df846e989ae5fd52190.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>Embark on an incredible adventure through the Edgeland with Wawa United! Control one or several frogs, or bring your friends along to embark on incredible quests for riches and rewards!<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/d0f95e3f7b426b13fedc7564379edff9.avif?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/ac8700196d648140d2e09889aa36092a.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>Wawa United is a cooperative platformer where players must work together to navigate through levels, solve puzzles, and defeat enemies, all while competing to collect the most gems! Each level can be played solo by controlling multiple characters simultaneously, or with friends in multiplayer mode.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/7c9e0f865ccf2c09ccecb3a675f2435c.poster.avif?t=1719738371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/7c9e0f865ccf2c09ccecb3a675f2435c.webm?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/7c9e0f865ccf2c09ccecb3a675f2435c.mp4?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/4ffa513e23603384ac81ff5baeee49f7.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>Before setting off on your adventure, invite your friends to visit your lair. Impress them with your collection! Display all the treasures you\u2019ve collected on your adventures in your lobby for everyone to see. Discover different merchants scattered around the world who offer unique items for purchase.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/8bcf9f01797b3a77e6a8b472b98bfbba.poster.avif?t=1719738371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/8bcf9f01797b3a77e6a8b472b98bfbba.webm?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/8bcf9f01797b3a77e6a8b472b98bfbba.mp4?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/d86c9578e978a63d49d0ad6501d4cbe3.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>To complete levels, teamwork is essential, but always keep an eye on the precious gems scattered along the way. Don\u2019t be too greedy though\u2014one wrong move could cause your whole team to lose previous gems!<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/82e1dd253c0f3ecc93543c08d9228342.poster.avif?t=1719738371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/82e1dd253c0f3ecc93543c08d9228342.webm?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/82e1dd253c0f3ecc93543c08d9228342.mp4?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/3e4649dcfa22c1e6944197aa5e41644b.webp?t=1719738371\" /></div><br><br>The Infinite Tower offers a special challenge: a level that only ends once you\u2019ve taken 10 hits. Only the bravest adventurers can reap the biggest rewards! Your performances will be ranked with every player out there. If you manage to get ahead of the crowd, your name will be seen by everyone on the banners scattered within the Tower! Beware, so shall your grave!<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/e50e0208c9ff6bd73b2253374a5c6cd4.poster.avif?t=1719738371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/e50e0208c9ff6bd73b2253374a5c6cd4.webm?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1016030/extras/e50e0208c9ff6bd73b2253374a5c6cd4.mp4?t=1719738371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Levels are available for either 2 players (currently) or 4 players (in the future), with the option to play through matchmaking or by inviting your Steam friends.",
